# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 工具重写文件时翻转成 CRLF
# （曾导致 plan-fail-path 等基于字符串锚点的回归测试在 CRLF 下永久失败）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确二进制文件，避免被当文本转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

# Windows 批处理保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
